00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:41.840
 so that they couldn't run away from doing the lecture.

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:43.640
 And this was based off the story

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:46.680
 of a scientist called Wigstone, who supposedly got cold feet

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:49.320
 and he ran away, and Michael Faraday had to come at the last

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.920
 second and do his speech on behalf.

