 But they love the idea of it so much

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:07.920
 that they did then just start locking scientists in the room,

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.560
 for 10 minutes prior to the lecture.

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.200
