 Never lectured here as far as I know.

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.360
 John Tyndall, the physicist, 19th century.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:29.240
 In 1867, he put solid carbonic acid in his mouth.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:32.640
 And then he breathed out over a candle while this was in his mouth.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.840
 And the candle turned blue and then it went out

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.280
