 And that--

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.200
 And he was fine.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:14.880
 But that's an example of the Leidenfrost effect, where, you know,

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:15.880
 the--

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:16.880
 the--

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:17.880
 the--

