 and you pour water on it, it kind of bounces around.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:25.440
 Yeah, the water evaporates on contact

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.720
 and it makes this tiny, tiny protective layer

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.360
 between you and the molten hot lead.

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:30.960
 But he was fine.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.880
 Maybe, and maybe, you know--

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.440
 I think that's amazing because that was in 1938, right?

